{"id":"b2a9860b6b90f561","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library.md","title":"二进制树编码所需的PR程序库","display":"df-primitive-recursive-binary-library — 二进制树编码所需的PR程序库","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library","aliases":["72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library"],"display":"df-primitive-recursive-binary-library — 二进制树编码所需的PR程序库","depends_on":["[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]"],"chapter":"IV","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV §2.1.1 print232/PDF244 and Ch.II §1.2.8 print89/PDF101; explicit local PR implementation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursive-binary-library — 二进制树编码所需的PR程序库"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IV"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV §2.1.1 print232/PDF244 and Ch.II §1.2.8 print89/PDF101; explicit local PR implementation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(n),S,P(n,i),\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec}\">\\(Z(n),S,P(n,i),\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec}\\)</span>、程序元数及解释取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a814f5220a079de\" href=\"?note=1a814f5220a079de\" title=\"72-df-primitive-recursive-program\">72-df-primitive-recursive-program</a>，递归参数在最后一位。下列字体为程序标签，不是对象语言额外原语。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec u\">\\(\\vec u\\)</span> 为互异有限变量标签表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}\\)</span> 是变量、自然常量及已定义程序应用的有限树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[e]_{\\vec u}\">\\([e]_{\\vec u}\\)</span> 为程序编译。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,1,2\">\\(0,1,2\\)</span> 在编译括号内是对应自然常量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 的有界和构造仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1\\)</span> 下使用，最后输入为界。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}&amp;::=u_i\\ (i&lt;|\\vec u|)\\mid\\underline k\\ (k\\in\\omega)\\mid c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\\ (\\operatorname{ar}(c)=m),\\\\\nK(n,0)&amp;:=Z(n),\\quad K(n,k+1):=\\operatorname{Comp}(n,1,S,\\langle K(n,k)\\rangle),\\\\\n[u_i]_{\\vec u}&amp;:=P(|\\vec u|,i),\\quad[\\underline k]_{\\vec u}:=K(|\\vec u|,k),\\\\\n[c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})]_{\\vec u}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Comp}(|\\vec u|,m,c,\\langle[e_i]_{\\vec u}\\rangle_{i&lt;m}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{badd}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[S(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bmul}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,Z(1),[\\mathsf{badd}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpred}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,Z(0),P(2,0)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bsub}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[\\mathsf{bpred}(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bnot}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),Z(2)),\\quad\n\\mathsf{bnz}:=[\\mathsf{bnot}(\\mathsf{bnot}(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{blt}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bnz}(\\mathsf{bsub}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\quad\n\\mathsf{ble}:=[\\mathsf{bnot}(\\mathsf{blt}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bif}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{badd}(\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnz}(b),x),\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnot}(b),y))]_{b,x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpow}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,K(1,1),[\\mathsf{bmul}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\Sigma_b(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{badd}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z})\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bquot}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnz}(b),\\Sigma_b([\\mathsf{ble}(\\mathsf{bmul}(b,S(j)),a)]_{a,b,j})(a,b,S(a)))]_{a,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{brem}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bsub}(a,\\mathsf{bmul}(b,\\mathsf{bquot}(a,b)))]_{a,b}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}&amp;::=u_i\\ (i&lt;|\\vec u|)\\mid\\underline k\\ (k\\in\\omega)\\mid c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\\ (\\operatorname{ar}(c)=m),\\\\\nK(n,0)&amp;:=Z(n),\\quad K(n,k+1):=\\operatorname{Comp}(n,1,S,\\langle K(n,k)\\rangle),\\\\\n[u_i]_{\\vec u}&amp;:=P(|\\vec u|,i),\\quad[\\underline k]_{\\vec u}:=K(|\\vec u|,k),\\\\\n[c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})]_{\\vec u}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Comp}(|\\vec u|,m,c,\\langle[e_i]_{\\vec u}\\rangle_{i&lt;m}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{badd}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[S(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bmul}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,Z(1),[\\mathsf{badd}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpred}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,Z(0),P(2,0)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bsub}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[\\mathsf{bpred}(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bnot}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),Z(2)),\\quad\n\\mathsf{bnz}:=[\\mathsf{bnot}(\\mathsf{bnot}(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{blt}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bnz}(\\mathsf{bsub}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\quad\n\\mathsf{ble}:=[\\mathsf{bnot}(\\mathsf{blt}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bif}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{badd}(\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnz}(b),x),\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnot}(b),y))]_{b,x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpow}&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,K(1,1),[\\mathsf{bmul}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\Sigma_b(c)&amp;:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{badd}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z})\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bquot}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnz}(b),\\Sigma_b([\\mathsf{ble}(\\mathsf{bmul}(b,S(j)),a)]_{a,b,j})(a,b,S(a)))]_{a,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{brem}&amp;:=[\\mathsf{bsub}(a,\\mathsf{bmul}(b,\\mathsf{bquot}(a,b)))]_{a,b}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>所有命名均为先前程序的有限复合或原始递归；编译严格递归到表达式子树，故给唯一 PRProg。bsub 为截断减法，bnot 为零检测，ble 为 ≤ 的0/1特征函数。对正 b，有界和统计满足 b(j+1)≤a 的 j，恰得 floor(a/b)；b=0 的外乘因子将商置0，余数为a。程序定义不依赖另一个书号或某个未展开的“标准PR编码”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-primitive-recursive-program","status":"resolved","id":"1a814f5220a079de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$Z(n),S,P(n,i),\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec}$、程序元数及解释取 [[72-df-primitive-recursive-program]]，递归参数在最后一位。下列字体为程序标签，不是对象语言额外原语。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"Z(n),S,P(n,i),\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}","display":false},{"tex":"[e]_{\\vec u}","display":false},{"tex":"0,1,2","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal E_{\\vec u}&::=u_i\\ (i<|\\vec u|)\\mid\\underline k\\ (k\\in\\omega)\\mid c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})\\ (\\operatorname{ar}(c)=m),\\\\\nK(n,0)&:=Z(n),\\quad K(n,k+1):=\\operatorname{Comp}(n,1,S,\\langle K(n,k)\\rangle),\\\\\n[u_i]_{\\vec u}&:=P(|\\vec u|,i),\\quad[\\underline k]_{\\vec u}:=K(|\\vec u|,k),\\\\\n[c(e_0,\\ldots,e_{m-1})]_{\\vec u}&:=\\operatorname{Comp}(|\\vec u|,m,c,\\langle[e_i]_{\\vec u}\\rangle_{i<m}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{badd}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[S(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bmul}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,Z(1),[\\mathsf{badd}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpred}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,Z(0),P(2,0)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bsub}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,P(1,0),[\\mathsf{bpred}(z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bnot}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(0,K(0,1),Z(2)),\\quad\n\\mathsf{bnz}:=[\\mathsf{bnot}(\\mathsf{bnot}(x))]_x,\\\\\n\\mathsf{blt}&:=[\\mathsf{bnz}(\\mathsf{bsub}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\quad\n\\mathsf{ble}:=[\\mathsf{bnot}(\\mathsf{blt}(y,x))]_{x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bif}&:=[\\mathsf{badd}(\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnz}(b),x),\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnot}(b),y))]_{b,x,y},\\\\\n\\mathsf{bpow}&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(1,K(1,1),[\\mathsf{bmul}(x,z)]_{x,y,z}),\\\\\n\\Sigma_b(c)&:=\\operatorname{Rec}(n,Z(n),[\\mathsf{badd}(z,c(\\vec x,y))]_{\\vec x,y,z})\\quad(\\operatorname{ar}(c)=n+1),\\\\\n\\mathsf{bquot}&:=[\\mathsf{bmul}(\\mathsf{bnz}(b),\\Sigma_b([\\mathsf{ble}(\\mathsf{bmul}(b,S(j)),a)]_{a,b,j})(a,b,S(a)))]_{a,b},\\\\\n\\mathsf{brem}&:=[\\mathsf{bsub}(a,\\mathsf{bmul}(b,\\mathsf{bquot}(a,b)))]_{a,b}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3246,"backlinks":[{"id":"0631285f0a620556","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-42","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IV章新增5项：[[72-df-binary-sequence-programs]] · [[72-df-full-omega-model]] · [[72-df-primitive-recursive-binary-library]] · [[72-thm-binary-sequence-program-correctness]] · [[72-thm-full-omega-model-subsystems]]"},{"